*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Simulated ET-8500 capabilities used when the app runs without CUPS
*% (for example while developing on Windows). On a Mac the app reads the
*% real PPD from /etc/cups/ppd instead, so these values are only a stand-in.
*ModelName: "EPSON ET-8500 Series (simulated)"
*NickName: "EPSON ET-8500 Series (simulated)"
*ColorDevice: True

